* The 3n+1 problem. Halve n if it is even, otherwise treble it and add 1,
* and go on until it is 1.
1.1 Type n in form 1.
1.2 Done if n = 1.
1.3 Set k = k+1.
1.4 To step 1.7 if fp(n/2) = 0.
1.5 Set n = 3·n+1.
1.6 To step 1.1.
1.7 Set n = n/2.
1.8 To step 1.1.
Form 1:
_____

Set k = 0.
Set n = 7.
Do part 1.
Type k.
